@page "/parallel-you"

<PageTitle>Parallel You</PageTitle>

<section class="home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">A living record of becoming</p>
        <h1>Notice what is true.<br /><em>Choose what comes next.</em></h1>
        <p class="home-hero__lede">
            Parallel You preserves your observations without flattening them into conclusions.
            Capture the present, reflect on what it means, and form direction without pretending
            certainty arrived first.
        </p>
        <div class="home-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/parallel-you/capture">Capture what is present</a>
            <a class="home-actions__quiet" href="/parallel-you/captures">Open your library <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orbit__ring orbit__ring--outer"></div>
        <div class="orbit__ring orbit__ring--inner"></div>
        <div class="orbit__present"></div>
        <div class="orbit__possible"></div>
        <span class="orbit__label orbit__label--present">present</span>
        <span class="orbit__label orbit__label--possible">possible</span>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="practice-flow" aria-labelledby="practice-heading">
    <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">The practice</p>
        <h2 id="practice-heading">A path, not a verdict.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="practice-grid">
        <a class="practice-card" href="/parallel-you/capture">
            <span class="practice-card__number">01</span>
            <h3>Preserve</h3>
            <p>Put down the thought, observation, or question before interpretation changes it.</p>
            <span class="practice-card__link">Begin a capture →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="practice-card" href="/parallel-you/reflect">
            <span class="practice-card__number">02</span>
            <h3>Understand</h3>
            <p>Return with context. Add evidence and insight while keeping the earlier record intact.</p>
            <span class="practice-card__link">Enter reflection →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="practice-card" href="/parallel-you/intentions">
            <span class="practice-card__number">03</span>
            <h3>Direct</h3>
            <p>Shape intentions, plans, and recommendations as revisable bases for action.</p>
            <span class="practice-card__link">Consider direction →</span>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<aside class="home-principle">
    <span class="home-principle__mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
    <p>The record may change what you see. It does not get to decide for you.</p>
</aside>
